{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"elf_bear_rider","model_identifier":"elf_bear_rider","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# elf_bear_rider\n\nElf bear rider (A3), cavalry, rider for elf_war_bear, 1.9 m elf (68 u).\n\nBladewarden in the same light leaf-plate (leaf-scale chest, layered pauldrons, tassets, steel bracers and greaves, silver circlet), riding astride the elf war bear and using the glaive like a lance. Long knife at the left hip as backup. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 37 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.0..10.0, y 0.0..68.8, z -6.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n- Riding: every ride clip keeps the hips at their own pivot (0, 34, 0); place that point on elf_war_bear `slot_rider` (0, 47.5, -3). The root then sits 13.5 u above the ground, so the death clip (root down 13.5 u in total) lands the body on the ground beside the bear.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- use elf_war_bear's box plus 16 x 50 x 14 above the saddle while mounted; after death the body lies at about x = +24\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `ride` | 0.9 | loop | seated, glaive raised at a slant (loop) |\n| `ride_charge` | 0.45 | loop | glaive levelled forward like a couched lance (loop); the hit is the bear's charge contact |\n| `ride_thrust` | 0.8 | once | key 0.35 s: glaive point at full reach forward (one target) |\n| `ride_slash` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: blade sweeps down through targets on the right side (arc) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | seated flinch |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | slumps and slides off the bear's right side; lands on its back about 24 u to the right at 1.2 s and holds |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `ride`: matches elf_war_bear walk (0.9 s cycle, bob twice per cycle)\n- `ride_charge`: matches elf_war_bear run/charge (0.45 s cycle)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `ride_thrust`: key 0.35 s: glaive point at full reach forward (one target)\n- `ride_slash`: key 0.45 s: blade sweeps down through targets on the right side (arc)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 68, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 47.5, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 51.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 57.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 45.5, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 38.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 37, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 37, 2)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `glaive` (visible, under slot_hand_r): the bladewarden glaive, 75 u, used lance-fashion\n- `long_knife_sheathed` (visible, slot_hip_l) / `long_knife` (hidden, slot_hand_r): as on elf_bladewarden\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- glaive: second grip (left hand) 17 u along the shaft forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_bear_rider_silver.png`: silver hair\n- `elf_bear_rider_gold.png`: pale gold hair\n- `elf_bear_rider_black.png`: black hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- Mounting: the hips stay at their pivot (0, 34, 0); place that on elf_war_bear `slot_rider` (0, 47.5, -3), i.e. rider root at y = 13.5 in bear space.\n- death is authored for that mounted offset: the final pose rests on the bear's ground (y = -13.5 in rider space). If the game detaches the corpse, keep the world transform.\n"},"description":"# elf_bear_rider\n\nElf bear rider (A3), cavalry, rider for elf_war_bear, 1.9 m elf (68 u).\n\nBladewarden in the same light leaf-plate (leaf-scale chest, layered pauldrons, tassets, steel bracers and greaves, silver circlet), riding astride the elf war bear and using the glaive like a lance. Long knife at the left hip as backup. Baseline skeleton and slot names.\n\n- Cubes: 37 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -10.0..10.0, y 0.0..68.8, z -6.0..4.5 (faces -Z).\n\n- Riding: every ride clip keeps the hips at their own pivot (0, 34, 0); place that point on elf_war_bear `slot_rider` (0, 47.5, -3). The root then sits 13.5 u above the ground, so the death clip (root down 13.5 u in total) lands the body on the ground beside the bear.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- use elf_war_bear's box plus 16 x 50 x 14 above the saddle while mounted; after death the body lies at about x = +24\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `ride` | 0.9 | loop | seated, glaive raised at a slant (loop) |\n| `ride_charge` | 0.45 | loop | glaive levelled forward like a couched lance (loop); the hit is the bear's charge contact |\n| `ride_thrust` | 0.8 | once | key 0.35 s: glaive point at full reach forward (one target) |\n| `ride_slash` | 1 | once | key 0.45 s: blade sweeps down through targets on the right side (arc) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | seated flinch |\n| `death` | 1.5 | hold | slumps and slides off the bear's right side; lands on its back about 24 u to the right at 1.2 s and holds |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `ride`: matches elf_war_bear walk (0.9 s cycle, bob twice per cycle)\n- `ride_charge`: matches elf_war_bear run/charge (0.45 s cycle)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `ride_thrust`: key 0.35 s: glaive point at full reach forward (one target)\n- `ride_slash`: key 0.45 s: blade sweeps down through targets on the right side (arc)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 68, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 47.5, 4)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (2.5, 51.5, 4)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (4, 57.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 45.5, -4)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-10, 38.5, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-7, 30.5, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (5.5, 37, 2)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-5.5, 37, 2)\n\n## Preview / carried items in slots\n\n- `glaive` (visible, under slot_hand_r): the bladewarden glaive, 75 u, used lance-fashion\n- `long_knife_sheathed` (visible, slot_hip_l) / `long_knife` (hidden, slot_hand_r): as on elf_bladewarden\n\n## Second grips (two-handed items)\n\n- glaive: second grip (left hand) 17 u along the shaft forward of the right hand\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `elf_bear_rider_silver.png`: silver hair\n- `elf_bear_rider_gold.png`: pale gold hair\n- `elf_bear_rider_black.png`: black hair\n\n## Notes\n\n- Mounting: the hips stay at their pivot (0, 34, 0); place that on elf_war_bear `slot_rider` (0, 47.5, -3), i.e. rider root at y = 13.5 in bear space.\n- death is authored for that mounted offset: the final pose rests on the bear's ground (y = -13.5 in rider space). If the game detaches the corpse, keep the world transform.\n","resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.5,34.0,-2.5],"to":[4.5,38.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,34.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[117,77,126.0,81.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[9,82,14.0,86.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,82,9.0,86.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[14,82,19.0,86.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[33,77,42.0,82.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[42,77,51.0,82.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"7cd6ff10-e426-5a98-8e01-33b63bbfeba9"},{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-5.5,38.0,-2.5],"to":[5.5,56.0,2.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,38.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[22,0,33.0,18.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[44,0,49.0,18.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[33,0,44.0,18.0],"